WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:01,980
The police district has been notified

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:05,220
They'll send someone up right away. You're welcome.

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,740
It just so happened that Officer Su and I were on vacation to accompany my brother hiking in the mountains.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,420
If something like this happens, you must take care of it.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,820
Can you add your Fetion?

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,500
I want to give you police chess

7
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,620
Wait until I mix it up

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,820
I'll definitely treat you to dinner

9
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,180
And just now

10
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,380
Thank you for helping me grow up like this

11
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:24,260
This is the first time someone has taken the initiative to ask me for Fetion. You're welcome.

12
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,740
The people's police serve the people

13
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,940
I am the brother of a policeman

14
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:27,980
Naturally, there is no excuse

15
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,300
No need to eat or anything like that

16
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,220
He is

17
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,580
Rejected me
